<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Friday 100,000-USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Friday 100,000-USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Friday's est receipts 100,000, Wk ago 92,000, Yr ago 102,000. Saturday's 15,000, 13,000, and 29,000 head. Estimates include generally about 60 percent carcass base hogs. Barrows and gilts were $0.50 lower compared with mid-session Thursday. Trade was moderate for light to moderate demand and offerings. Top $54.00 per cwt.</p>
